% F01-LOWER: DEFECT 1.  IN A LOAD FILE (NOT UPPERCASED) A WORD WITH A
% CHARACTER ABOVE "Z" WAS A FLOAT LITERAL.  PATCHED, x IS UNDEFINED, A
% COMPILE ERROR THAT ENDS THE FILE.
DECIMAL
FLOAT<
"GOOD    " MSG 1.5 .= CR
"LOWER   " MSG 5 x = .= SPACE 1x5 .= SPACE 2_5 .= SPACE 7[ .= CR
"NOT REACHED IF PATCHED" MSG CR
